+# Secrets for `kamal setup` / `kamal deploy`, referenced from config/deploy.yml.
+#
+# Fill these in before running `bin/kamal setup`. Each line pulls the value
+# from your shell environment (export the variable before running kamal), but
+# you can also paste the value directly after the `=`, or run a command with
+# $(...). If you paste real values here, do not commit them to a public repo.
+
+# Password or access token for the Docker registry in config/deploy.yml.
+KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD
+
+# Signs and encrypts sessions, cookies, and other data. Generate one with:
+#   bin/rails secret
+SECRET_KEY_BASE=$SECRET_KEY_BASE
+
+# VAPID key pair for browser push notifications. Generate one with:
+#   bin/rails runner 'key = WebPush.generate_key; puts "VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=#{key.public_key}", "VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=#{key.private_key}"'
+VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=$VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY
+VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=$VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY
+
+# Uncomment if your SMTP server requires a password (see config/deploy.yml):
+# SMTP_PASSWORD=$SMTP_PASSWORD
